# Docs are hand-authored: Prettier reflows tables whose cells contain pipe
# characters (JSON examples), which corrupts them.
*.md

# Generated artifacts whose producer owns their formatting. Letting Prettier
# reformat them afterwards means the committed file never matches a fresh
# generation, so the check that compares the two fails on a file nobody edited.
docs/openapi
**/__goldens__

# Generated by `pnpm content:export`, and byte-stable on purpose: the exporter sorts
# keys and entities so two runs of identical content produce identical files. Letting
# Prettier restyle it would mean every export showed a diff until somebody reformatted
# it, which is exactly the churn the sorting exists to prevent.
content-snapshot/*.json
